            <h3 class="headline">
                <span>Do...Repeat If (expression) - Selenium IDE command</span>
            </h3>
        </div> 

        <div class="span12">

            <p>
                The part between  <span class="hired">Do</span> and  <span class="hired">Repeat If (expression)</span> is executed as long as the expression is true.
                RepeatIf uses  <a href="/rpa/docs/selenium-ide/executescript#sandbox">executeScript_Sandbox</a> to evaluate the expression.


                If the expression is false, the IDE executes the immediate next command <em>Repeat If</em>.
            </p>

            <p>
